# 7. 📂 Installing Interesting File Finder

A second reconnaissance module was installed to identify potentially interesting web-accessible resources.

The module was searched through the marketplace and installed:

```bash
marketplace install discovery/info_disclosure/interesting_files
```

The module was then loaded:

```bash
modules load discovery/info_disclosure/interesting_files
```

The module information was inspected:

```bash
info
```

The module is designed to check hosts for files and resources located at predictable paths.

